---
description:
  With htmlLabels enabled, verifies that `classDef default` styling is
  automatically applied to every node with no explicit `class` assignment (B and
  C), while nodes given an explicit class via `class A myClass1` and `class D
  myClass2` use their own class styles instead.
config:
  flowchart:
    htmlLabels: true
---
graph TD
  A[myClass1] --> B[default] & C[default]
  B[default] & C[default] --> D[myClass2]
  classDef default stroke-width:2px,fill:none,stroke:silver
  classDef node color:red
  classDef myClass1 color:#0000ff
  classDef myClass2 stroke:#0000ff,fill:#ccccff
  class A myClass1
  class D myClass2
